Question 2: Log Aggregation by Service (Medium)
Problem

You are given application logs:

class LogEntry {
    String serviceName;
    long timestamp;
    int responseTime;
}


Write a method that returns the average response time per service for logs within the last K seconds.

Input

List<LogEntry> logs

currentTime

K

Output
Map<String, Double>  // service → average response time

Constraints

Logs are not sorted

Large input size

What they look for

Efficient filtering

Proper use of Map

Avoid unnecessary sorting

Handling empty results
